WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.600
In the Heian era, Fujiwara Sai

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.600
After a great span of time

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.100
Was reborn in the heart of Shindou Hikaru

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.400
To master the Move Of God

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.130
You are holding me up strong

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.300
I am holding you as well

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:26.130
So let us now while wandering, live together

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.810
towards the future

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:40.070
Even when I'm capricing with my friends

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:44.390
I feel an emptiness in my heart

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:46.100
Looked at with cold eyes

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:51.300
I'm blown by the winds of a dry age

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:59.930
Feelings of doubt and courage are back to back

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:08.390
but I'll make these dreams come true now with my own hands

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:14.190
The days where I'm hurt and about to break

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:20.140
The days where I cry and trouble you They all exist

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:24.340
but we will get over it heading

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:29.430
Higher then anyone else

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:58.700
If I… Like that

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.500
Like That!

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:10.500
Hikaru

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.700
Match #4 Kaga in Shogi Club

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:38.900
Sai…

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:44.100
You didn't… Just…

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:47.100
Take over my body?

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:51.400
Hey

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:54.800
What just happened?

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:57.800
Is it because I forced him to come in?

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.600
How good was he?

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.900
There is no fault in the layout of his Stones

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:09.700
Perfect like a

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:11.500
pro's instructive Go

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:12.200
That means..

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:20.000
All that means is his opening moves are perfect,
I can't tell about his talent

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.800
I see

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:24.200
Besides that

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.200
Besides that?

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:27.700
No

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:33.100
Only his last move really stood out

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:36.800
It may be a bad move when you look at it

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:38.400
However

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:43.400
You Bastard!!! You just took over my body, didn't you

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.300
Not only do you invade my body

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:47.100
You take it over aswell

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:50.400
There's no way I could've laid a stone like that by myself

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.100
Y-Your Mistaken

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:55.300
I can't take over your body

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.700
Then, you're saying that I did that by myself?

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:59.000
That's right

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.400
Lair

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:03.000
