00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:49.900
She came this late?

00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:51.200
Hurry up, make your move!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:52.700
Sorry

00:19:53.600 --> 00:19:55.100
Hikaru! That's not the place

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:00.600
Wa-Wait!

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:02.900
Wait, Stop Joking

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:06.000
They're all dead

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:10.000
It can't be helped... 12-15

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:16.400
That one moved killed them all

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:25.200
That many

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:32.000
Now, wanna admit your defeat?

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:36.000
That pool is waiting for you

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:45.750
where is it
どこにあるのかな

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:49.580
The treasure that belongs to me
ボクだけの宝物

00:20:50.370 --> 00:20:56.500
Now towards a great adventure
今　大きな冒険へ

00:20:57.180 --> 00:20:59.140
The gentle sunlight
やわらかな日差し

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:01.530
A feeling of depature
旅立ちの予感

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:05.550
The sky and the flower are both laughing
空も花も　ホラ 笑っている

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:10.470
I wonder what waits ahead for me
この先には何が待つのだろう

00:21:10.670 --> 00:21:12.660
Take A deep breath
深呼吸

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:20.900
Place your hand gently on the door to your dreams, and let's go
夢の扉にそっと手をかけて　行こう

00:21:21.000 --> 00:21:23.000
While blown by the wind
風に吹かれながら

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.800
While rocking your heart
心揺らしながら

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:29.300
holding a blank map in one hand
真っ白な地図を片手に持ちながら

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:31.100
While blown by the wind
風に吹かれながら

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:33.250
While drawing in tomorrow
明日を描きながら

00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:34.880
far away until I
遠くまで　何処まで

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:37.500
reach that place
たどり着けるまで

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:41.600
I won't lose, I wont cry
絶対負けないよ　絶対泣かないよ

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:46.110
Until the day that i make this dream come true
この夢を叶えるその日までは

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:47.990
The sky was laughing
あの空は笑っていた

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:50.030
That flower was laughing too
あの花は笑っていた

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:53.780
Some day I will laugh with you
ボクもいつか笑うから

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:58.070
I will surpass any obstacle
どんな壁も越えるから

00:21:58.450 --> 00:22:03.550
I'm not afraid of anything any more
もう　何も何も　コワクナイ

00:22:58.270 --> 00:23:01.120
佐為 你明明說沒問題的

00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:05.730
筒井 圍棋大會團體賽的人選決定了

00:23:05.960 --> 00:23:07.450
現在終於有點明白了

00:23:08.670 --> 00:23:11.720
我為什麼會附在小光身上

00:23:22.520 --> 00:23:26.490
落子無悔 所以每一手都要三思
